# 🎨 UI · UX Design System & Cursor Rules

> **Naming convention**: `FooBarAtom.vue` → `FooBarMolecule.vue`
> → `FooBarOrganism.vue` → `FooBarTemplate.vue` → `FooBarPage.vue`

---

## 1 · Core Principles

| # | Principle | Rationale |
|---|-----------|-----------|
| 1 | **Visual Consistency** | Use the design‑token system for colours, spacing, typography. |
| 2 | **User‑Centred** | UI explains itself: instant feedback, inline help, real‑time validation. |
| 3 | **Accessibility First** | WCAG 2.2 AA contrast, 44 × 44 px hit‑areas, focus rings, ARIA roles. |
| 4 | **Performance Aware** | Lazy‑load heavy organisms; prefer CSS‑only animations; bundle ≤ 200 kB/route. |
| 5 | **International‑Ready** | All text from `t()` helpers; no hard‑coded language. |

---

## 2 · Atomic Catalogue

### 2.1 Atoms
| Atom | Rules |
|------|-------|
| **IconButtonAtom** | 24 px icon; wrap in `VTooltip` if label not visible; `aria-label` required. |
| **ChipAtom** | Tonal variant; max one line; optional 16 px start icon. |
| **InputAtom** | Emits `update:modelValue`; inline error via `v-messages`. |
| **AlertAtom** | Four variants (info, success, warning, error). Uses `StateColors`. |
| **StateColors** | Success `#16A34A` · Warning `#EAB308` · Error `#DC2626` · Info `#2563EB`. |

### 2.2 Molecules
| Molecule | Composition |
|----------|-------------|
| **HeaderBarMolecule** | `TypographyAtom` (`h6`) + `ChipAtom` + optional `IconButtonAtom` (settings). |
| **TabsHeaderMolecule** | `VTabs` with `IconButtonAtom` + label; keyboard navigable & scrollable. |
| **ExpandablePanelMolecule** | Summary row + chevron `IconButtonAtom`; expands via `VExpandTransition`. |
| **DialogHeaderMolecule** | Title + close `IconButtonAtom`; placed in every modal organ‑ ism. |

### 2.3 Organisms
| Organism | Role |
|----------|------|
| **ReportBuilderOrganism** | Hosts field mapping, data‑source picker, preview, save. |
| **FieldSelectorOrganism** | Two draggable lists with handle icon (`tabler-grip-vertical`). |
| **AdvancedConfigDialogOrganism** | Modal with form Molecules; validates via VeeValidate. |
| **StepperOrganism** | Multi‑step wizard; progress bar; emits `submit` when finalised. |

### 2.4 Templates
* **DefaultTemplate** – App bar, nav drawer, `<router-view>`.  
* **ModalTemplate** – Centered dialog, max‑width 640 px, focus‑trap.  
* **StepperTemplate** – Places `StepperOrganism` full‑width on desktop, stacked on mobile.

---

## 3 · Interaction Patterns

| Pattern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| **Drag & Drop** | `vuedraggable`; handle icon; ghost opacity 0.6; announce via `aria-live`. |
| **Tabs** | Use `TabsHeaderMolecule`; scroll‑buttons auto on overflow; maintain deep‑link via `:to` route query. |
| **Panels (Expandable)** | `ExpandablePanelMolecule`; default collapsed; animation 200 ms ease‑in‑out. |
| **Dialogs / Modals** | Use `ModalTemplate`; trap focus; close on **Esc** & backdrop‑click; primary action first in tab‑order. |
| **Stepper** | `StepperOrganism`; min 4 px progress bar above; disable “Next” until step valid; emit `step-change` event. |
| **Real‑Time Validation** | Validate on `input` & `blur`; message ≤ 80 chars. |
| **Loading & Empty States** | Spinner delay 200 ms; skeletons for lists > 3 items; empty‑state illustration + CTA. |
| **Error Handling** | Show `AlertAtom`; provide retry action. |

